# .gembaflow-overrides
#
# Files that are intentionally local to this fork.
# upgrade.sh and pull-upstream.sh will never overwrite these.
#
# One path per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
# Paths are relative to the repo root.

# Metadata directory is always local — never stomped by upstream upgrades.
.gembaflow-meta/

# work-ticket.md contains substituted bootstrap-time templated values
# ({{bot.worker}}, {{bot.reviewer}}, etc. — see docs/PLATFORM-GUIDE.md
# "Bootstrap-time templated values"). Upstream sync overwriting it would
# re-introduce the placeholders, breaking the spec until
# substitute-config-placeholders.sh runs again. Forks that customize this
# file should keep this line; forks that don't can remove it (sync will
# then refresh placeholders, which the operator handles via a re-run of
# the substitution script).
.claude/commands/work-ticket.md
